flowchart TD
    A[Signup Request] --> B{Email Exists?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Return Fail]
    B -- No --> D[Create User]
    D --> E[Hash Password]
    E --> F[Save User]
    F --> G[Publish UserRegisteredEvent]
    G --> H[Issue Access + Refresh Token]
    H --> I[Return Success]

    J[Login Request] --> K[Find User by Email]
    K --> L{Password Valid?}
    L -- No --> M[Return Fail]
    L -- Yes --> N[Revoke Active Refresh Tokens]
    N --> O[Issue New Token Pair]
    O --> P[Return Success]
